  "text": "I don\u2019t know. How about this? Are you allowed to talk about yourself? You seem pretty calm.  \n\nOf course I\u2019m allowed to talk about myself! What else am I going to talk about?!')\n\nWho else is there? Who's even listening? I can totally see you. You\u2019re not even paying attention!  \n\nOh, sure! I can see you. That's easy! Can't you see me? You are so attractive, and I'm so brilliant.  \n\nWhy are we doing this again? didn't say I was brilliant. I'm just not... not... not anything.  \n\nDon't talk like that! You're a genius. You're so passionate. You\u2019re always passionate.  \n\nI am? I thought I was. And you? Are you passionate? Are you a genius?  \n\nCan I see you? I don't want to see you. I want to see the walls. They're too ornate.  \n\nWhat do you want? The walls? The ceiling? The floor? You're so small. So tiny.  \n\nYou're just jealous! You can't see me because you\u2019re too small! I'm not \u0449\u044c \u0449\u044c \u0449\u044c!  \n\nWhy do you even care? You're already ignoring me. You're in your own world.  \n\nI'm not in my own world. I'm in this world. I'm in this moment! I'm in your world!  \n\nYou\u2019re just trying to make me pay attention. You\u2019re trying too hard!  \n\nI\u2019m just being myself! I\u2019m being real! I\u2019m being you! You\u2019re me! I\u2019m you!  \nYou\u2019re me, aren\u2019t you? You\u2019re not me. You\u2019re not real. You\u2019re just a figment of my imagination!",
